+                                       method</a></li>
+        <li><a href="#doFinalization_fn">The <tt>doFinalization(Function
+                                         &amp;)</tt> method</a></li>
+        </ul></li>
+     <li><a href="#MachineFunctionPass">The <tt>MachineFunctionPass</tt>
+                                        class</a>
+        <ul>
